            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="arrow">→</div>
          <div class="panel">
            <h3>Kazakhstan, studied — not asked</h3>
            <p>Policy history, national-stability attitudes, protest, and activist strategy have all been studied here.</p>
            <p class="so-what">Means for my study: every one of these asks women already inside politics, or measures attitudes in aggregate — never her, in her own words.</p>
            <div class="cite-list">
